# Strip trailing slashes so every page has one canonical URL.
# Cloudflare's default asset serving otherwise treats /post/foo and
# /post/foo/ as separate valid pages, which Google indexes as duplicates.
#
# Deliberately NOT paired with astro.config.mjs's trailingSlash option this
# time: setting trailingSlash there made Astro's own SSR redirect handler
# fight this same rule in production (Cloudflare add-slash vs Astro
# strip-slash), causing a redirect loop across nearly every page on
# 2026-07-03. This file is the only system doing the redirecting now.
/*/ /:splat 301
